            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Уже темно, а ночлега у нас ещё нет. Uzhé temnó, a nochléga u nas yeshchyó net. It is already dark, and we still have nowhere to sleep."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Искать ночлег (nochlég) — to look for a place to stay the night."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ночлег (nochlég) is built from ночь 'night' and -лег, the root of лечь 'to lie down': a place to lie down for the night. EtymDB lists the word without a deeper source."
            }
          ]
        },
